      "answer": "```c\n#include <limits.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n\nsize_t lower_bound_int(const int *a, size_t n, int x) {\n    size_t lo = 0;\n    size_t hi = n;\n    while (lo < hi) {\n        size_t mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n        if (a[mid] < x) {\n            lo = mid + 1;\n        } else {\n            hi = mid;\n        }\n    }\n    return lo;\n}\n```\n"
